00000020  50 59 4f 52 41 43 4c 45  5f 42 49 4e 44 35 20 53  |PYORACLE_BIND5 S|
00000030  45 54 20 66 20 3d 20 3a  31 20 57 48 45 52 45 20  |ET f = :1 WHERE |
00000040  69 64 20 3d 20 31 01 01  01 01 00 00 00 00 00 72  |id = 1.........r|
00000050  01 00 00 02 02 12 00 00  00 00 01 1f 01 07 01 23  |...............#|
00000060  23 00 21 00 01 08 08 00  00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00  |#.!.............|
00000070  00 00 0a 50 59 4f 5f 4e  4f 5f 44 49 52 00 05 66  |...PYO_NO_DIR..f|
